ning, learning-situation briefing, common problems, family suggestions and closing.","teacherAssistant.prompt.parentMeetingMaterials.scoreReportWording":"Help me get the wording right for briefing score rankings at a parent meeting — truthfully reflecting the situation without provoking parents or stepping on landmines.","teacherAssistant.prompt.parentMeetingMaterials.sensitiveTopicResponse":"Help me get the wording right for the two sensitive topics of phone management and declining grades at the parent meeting.","teacherAssistant.prompt.personalizedEvaluation.classwideComments":"Based on the whole-class routine-performance records I provide, generate personalized end-of-term comments one per student, each targeted and non-repetitive.","teacherAssistant.prompt.personalizedEvaluation.commentRefinement":"Rewrite the comment \"This student performs well; hope you keep working hard\" to be more specific, warmer, and able to point out a next step for the student.","teacherAssistant.prompt.personalizedEvaluation.developmentalEvaluation":"For this student who improved in monthly-exam math from 60 to 78, write a developmental evaluation that affirms the progress and encourages continued effort.","teacherAssistant.prompt.personalizedEvaluation.performanceEvaluation":"Based on this student's active record-keeping and cooperative attitude in a group experiment, write a performance assessment that states what level he has reached.","teacherAssistant.prompt.personalizedEvaluation.termComment":"Based on this student's performance — fond of asking questions in math class but occasionally careless with homework — write a targeted, warm end-of-term comment that points a direction.","teacherAssistant.prompt.researchProject.fullProjectRoadmap":"Develop an end-to-end plan for the topic \"Cultivating Class Reading Habits,\" including required materials for each stage from topic selection and proposal to mid-term review and final report.","teacherAssistant.prompt.researchProject.proposalReport":"Create a proposal framework for \"Research on Differentiated Homework Design in Junior High English,\" covering background, objectives, content, methods, and expected outcomes.","teacherAssistant.prompt.researchProject.researchPlan":"Select appropriate research methods and design a feasible plan for the topic \"The Impact of Gamified Teaching on Primary Students' Interest in Character Recognition.\"","teacherAssistant.prompt.researchProject.researchTopic":"Refine the teaching challenge \"severe plagiarism in students' math homework\" into a researchable, valuable topic with a formal title.","teacherAssistant.prompt.researchProject.topicRiskReview":"Identify potential rejection issues in the topic and research design of \"AI-Assisted Essay Grading Research\" from a reviewer's perspective.","teacherAssistant.prompt.skillCreation.essayGradingSkill":"Help me turn my English-essay grading standards (scoring dimensions, common errors, revision-suggestion norms) into a reusable teaching skill, so that submitting an essay later grades it by my standards; explain how I should describe my experience clearly.","teacherAssistant.prompt.skillCreation.experienceSharingSkill":"Help me turn a set of home-school communication scripts from my class management into a shareable skill that same-grade teachers can call directly; explain what content should be precipitated.","teacherAssistant.prompt.skillCreation.guidedQuestionAnswerSkill":"Help me turn my \"guide only, don't give answers\" Q\u0026A style into a physics Q\u0026A skill; explain how to set the dialogue strategy and follow-up approach.","teacherAssistant.prompt.skillCreation.mathQuestionDesignSkill":"Help me turn my method of setting junior-high math problems (item types, difficulty tiers, exam-point distribution) into a skill, so that inputting a knowledge point and difficulty later generates items; explain how to build it.","teacherAssistant.prompt.skillCreation.recitationCheckSkill":"Help me turn classical-text recitation checking into a skill that can give the opening line for students to continue and give semantic hints; explain how to define the interaction flow.","teacherAssistant.prompt.studentTutoring.learningMethodGuidance":"For this junior-high student who memorizes vocabulary inefficiently with poor returns, give specific, actionable English study-method guidance.","teacherAssistant.prompt.studentTutoring.motivationStrategy":"Give me several actionable ways to rouse the enthusiasm of this junior-high student with low, listless learning motivation.","teacherAssistant.prompt.studentTutoring.remedialPlan":"For this student weak in math foundations, work out a step-by-step remediation plan that makes up ground point by point in knowledge order.","teacherAssistant.prompt.studentTutoring.remediationSequence":"For this junior-high math student with many gaps, map a remediation route specifying what to fix first and what next.","teacherAssistant.prompt.studentTutoring.weaknessDiagnosis":"Based on this student always erring on quadratic-function problems, diagnose exactly which knowledge point or which ability is weak.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teacherTraining.participatoryWorkshop":"Following adult-learning principles, design a training on \"item-setting techniques\" — not lecture-all-the-way, so participating teachers really take something away.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teacherTraining.schoolBasedTrainingPlan":"Design a school-based training plan on \"AI-assisted teaching\"; specify objectives, content modules, participatory activities and schedule.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teacherTraining.trainingContentDesign":"For the training theme \"homework design under the new curriculum standards\", arrange content and activities that get teachers moving and participating.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teacherTraining.trainingEffectEvaluation":"For the training \"improving head-teachers' communication skills\", design an effect-evaluation method to check whether it works and whether it transfers to practice.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teacherTraining.trainingNeedsAnalysis":"Design a needs-analysis method to find out what teachers in our school most need training on, and set the training theme accordingly.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingAnimation.animationScript":"Turn junior-high physics \"the formation of electric current\" into an animation script and storyboard that explains the mechanism clearly, labeling the visuals and narration of each shot.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingAnimation.conceptVisualization":"For the abstract process of junior-high biology \"blood circulation\", design a visualization plan that turns the invisible process into a visible picture.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingAnimation.microLessonScript":"Turn primary math \"understanding hours, minutes and seconds\" into a two-to-three-minute micro-lesson script, specifying the explanation order and the visuals of each step.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingAnimation.principleStepDiagram":"Break the dynamic process of senior-high chemistry \"how a galvanic cell works\" into several step diagrams, specifying what each step emphasizes so students grasp it most easily.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingAnimation.simulationResource":"Recommend ready-made disciplinary simulation or visualization resources that can demonstrate junior-high physics \"convex lens imaging\", ready to use directly.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingObjectives.coreCompetencyObjectives":"Based on the 2025 new curriculum standards, write a set of core-competency-oriented learning objectives for junior-high biology Photosynthesis, mapped to specific core competencies.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingObjectives.lessonObjectives":"For primary Chinese \"The Destruction of the Old Summer Palace\", write a set of first-lesson-hour objectives covering the core competencies it should achieve.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingObjectives.measurableObjectives":"For junior-high math \"Quadratic Functions\", write a set of observable, measurable learning objectives, all expressed with explicit behavioral verbs.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingObjectives.teachingLearningAssessmentObjectives":"For senior-high physics Newton's Second Law, write a set of learning objectives and, following teaching-learning-assessment alignment, pair them with the corresponding teaching activities and assessment methods.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingObjectives.unitObjectives":"For the Grade-8 junior-high English unit \"Simple Past Tense\", write a complete set of unit learning objectives, spelling out what students can do after learning.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingResearch.classroomObservationRubric":"Give me a lesson-observation rubric targeting \"student classroom participation\", with clear observation dimensions and easy checkboxes.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingResearch.lessonStudyDesign":"Turn the classroom problem \"group cooperation is a mere formality\" into a lesson study; specify how to do it and how to iterate repeatedly.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingResearch.researchBrief":"Distill the process and conclusions of this \"unit-holistic teaching\" research into a shareable teaching-research achievement brief.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingResearch.sameLessonDifferentDesign":"For junior-high Chinese \"The Sight of Father's Back\", design a same-lesson-different-design teaching-research session — two different ways of teaching — specifying each one's focus and observation points.","teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingResearch.teachingResearchActivity":"Plan a themed teaching-research activity on \"how to improve the effectiveness of classroom questioning\"; specify the process and what each phase should produce.","teacherAssistant.prompt.websiteDevelopment.classHomepage":"Help me build a class-homepage website showing the class pact, showcase, honor wall and activity album — youthful and lively style, viewable on both phone and computer.","teacherAssistant.prompt.websiteDevelopment.classroomTool":"Help me build a random-roll-call and grouping mini-tool webpage that, once the class roster is entered, can draw a name and auto-group with one click; explain how to use it.","teacherAssistant.prompt.websiteDevelopment.courseWebsite":"Help me build a junior-high physics course-learning website that organizes knowledge points, micro-lesson videos and exercises by chapter, so students can self-study; explain how I should do it.","teacherAssistant.prompt.websiteDevelopment.eventRegistrationSite":"Help me build a class-activity sign-up website where parents can pick time slots to sign up and fill in information, with a backend to view the sign-up list; explain how to implement it.","teacherAssistant.prompt.websiteDevelopment.studentWorkShowcase":"Help me build an online student-work showcase website that can upload essays, drawings and handicraft photos and support likes and comments; explain how to build it.","teacherAssistant.scene.classroomQuestioning":"Classroom-Questioning Design","teacherAssistant.scene.coursewareCreation":"Courseware Creation","teacherAssistant.scene.creativeTeaching":"Creative Instructional Design","teacherAssistant.scene.differentiatedHomework":"Tiered Homework","teacherAssistant.scene.differentiatedTeaching":"Differentiated Instruction","teacherAssistant.scene.homeSchoolCommunication":"Home-School Communication","teacherAssistant.scene.homeworkReview":"Homework Review","teacherAssistant.scene.learningSituationAnalysis":"Learning-Situation Analysis","teacherAssistant.scene.lessonPlanWriting":"Writing Lesson Plans","teacherAssistant.scene.openClassDesign":"Open-Class Design","teacherAssistant.scene.paperWriting":"Paper Writing","teacherAssistant.scene.parentMeetingMaterials":"Parent-Meeting Materials","teacherAssistant.scene.personalizedEvaluation":"Personalized Evaluation","teacherAssistant.scene.researchProject":"Research Projects","teacherAssistant.scene.skillCreation":"Skill Creation","teacherAssista