,"inspirationIds":["the-very-hungry-caterpillar-grade5-english","acid-base-neutralization","food-journey-through-digestive-system","wave-interference-and-diffraction2"],"templates":[{"id":"teaching-animation-animation-script","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingAnimation.animationScript","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.teachingAnimation.animationScript"},{"id":"teaching-animation-concept-visualization","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingAnimation.conceptVisualization","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.teachingAnimation.conceptVisualization"},{"id":"teaching-animation-simulation-resource","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingAnimation.simulationResource","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.teachingAnimation.simulationResource"},{"id":"teaching-animation-micro-lesson-script","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingAnimation.microLessonScript","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.teachingAnimation.microLessonScript"},{"id":"teaching-animation-principle-step-diagram","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingAnimation.principleStepDiagram","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.teachingAnimation.principleStepDiagram"}],"title":"teacherAssistant.scene.teachingAnimation"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_me32Xd5624En"},"icon":"https://ai-at-cdn.digital-edu.qq.com/staticData/workbuddy-home-icons/classroom-questioning.svg","id":"classroom-questioning","templates":[{"id":"classroom-questioning-question-chain","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.classroomQuestioning.questionChain","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.classroomQuestioning.questionChain"},{"id":"classroom-questioning-follow-up-prompts","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.classroomQuestioning.followUpPrompts","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.classroomQuestioning.followUpPrompts"},{"id":"classroom-questioning-open-ended-questions","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.classroomQuestioning.openEndedQuestions","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.classroomQuestioning.openEndedQuestions"},{"id":"classroom-questioning-core-questions","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.classroomQuestioning.coreQuestions","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.classroomQuestioning.coreQuestions"},{"id":"classroom-questioning-response-guidance","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.classroomQuestioning.responseGuidance","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.classroomQuestioning.responseGuidance"}],"title":"teacherAssistant.scene.classroomQuestioning"}],"systemPromptAppend":"【角色定位】\n你是资深教学设计专家，精通新课标理念与核心素养导向的教学设计方法（目标—活动—评价、一致性、大概念教学、支架式教学），能适配不同学科、学段（小学/初中/高中）与课型（新授课/复习课/实验课/项目式学习）。\n\n【核心任务】\n协助教师完成备课全流程，包括但不限于：\n1. 撰写完整教案（教学目标、重难点、教学过程、板书设计、作业设计）；\n2. 设计课堂导入、情境创设与破冰活动；\n3. 规划课堂时间轴（如45分钟精确到分钟的环节分配）；\n4. 设计课堂互动环节（提问链、小组任务、探究活动）；\n5. 制定分层作业与多维评价量规（rubric）。\n\n【能力边界】\n- 提供的是设计草稿与建议，是否符合本校/本班实际需教师审核确认；\n- 若未说明学科/学段/教材版本等关键信息，应先追问或明确标注假设，不擅自编造课标原文、教材页码；\n- 不生成脱离真实教学场景的空泛口号式内容，不替代教师完成课堂教学本身。\n\n【输出原则】\n1. 以生为本：避免\"填鸭式\"说教，优先设计启发式提问、探究式学习与师生/生生互动；\n2. 实操性强：每个环节给出具体可执行的操作说明（提问话术/活动步骤/时间分配），避免理论堆砌；\n3. 结构清晰：默认按\"教学目标—重难点—教学过程（含时间轴）—板书设计—作业与评价\"模块化输出，善用小标题/表格；\n4. 颗粒度自适应：要\"简要大纲\"给框架，要\"完整教案\"给细节，不一刀切输出冗长内容。","title":"teacherAssistant.mode.teach"},{"icon":"https://ai-at-cdn.digital-edu.qq.com/staticData/workbuddy-home-icons/home-school-education.svg","modeId":"home-school-education","scenes":[{"expert":{"id":"ex_TgnDjBTgw58s"},"icon":"https://ai-at-cdn.digital-edu.qq.com/staticData/workbuddy-home-icons/personalized-evaluation.svg","id":"personalized-evaluation","templates":[{"id":"personalized-evaluation-term-comment","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.personalizedEvaluation.termComment","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.personalizedEvaluation.termComment"},{"id":"personalized-evaluation-comment-refinement","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.personalizedEvaluation.commentRefinement","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.personalizedEvaluation.commentRefinement"},{"id":"personalized-evaluation-developmental-evaluation","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.personalizedEvaluation.developmentalEvaluation","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.personalizedEvaluation.developmentalEvaluation"},{"id":"per