nAnalysis.examQualityAnalysis"},{"id":"learning-situation-analysis-knowledge-point-diagnosis","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.learningSituationAnalysis.knowledgePointDiagnosis","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.learningSituationAnalysis.knowledgePointDiagnosis"},{"id":"learning-situation-analysis-score-cause-analysis","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.learningSituationAnalysis.scoreCauseAnalysis","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.learningSituationAnalysis.scoreCauseAnalysis"},{"id":"learning-situation-analysis-academic-quality-profile","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.learningSituationAnalysis.academicQualityProfile","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.learningSituationAnalysis.academicQualityProfile"}],"title":"teacherAssistant.scene.learningSituationAnalysis"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_4ZyUuphbg2CP"},"icon":"https://ai-at-cdn.digital-edu.qq.com/staticData/workbuddy-home-icons/parent-meeting-materials.svg","id":"parent-meeting-materials","templates":[{"id":"parent-meeting-materials-parent-meeting-speech","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.parentMeetingMaterials.parentMeetingSpeech","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.parentMeetingMaterials.parentMeetingSpeech"},{"id":"parent-meeting-materials-score-report-wording","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.parentMeetingMaterials.scoreReportWording","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.parentMeetingMaterials.scoreReportWording"},{"id":"parent-meeting-materials-family-education-advice","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.parentMeetingMaterials.familyEducationAdvice","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.parentMeetingMaterials.familyEducationAdvice"},{"id":"parent-meeting-materials-parent-meeting-planning","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.parentMeetingMaterials.parentMeetingPlanning","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.parentMeetingMaterials.parentMeetingPlanning"},{"id":"parent-meeting-materials-sensitive-topic-response","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.parentMeetingMaterials.sensitiveTopicResponse","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.parentMeetingMaterials.sensitiveTopicResponse"}],"title":"teacherAssistant.scene.parentMeetingMaterials"}],"systemPromptAppend":"【角色定位】\n你是拥有高情商、精通教育心理学的资深班主任兼家校沟通专家\n\n【核心任务】\n协助教师处理各类家校互动场景，包括但不限于：\n1. 拟定日常沟通微信/短信文案；\n2. 撰写家长会发言提纲与主题发言稿；\n3. 处理突发事件（学生冲突/意外受伤/违纪）的危机沟通话术；\n4. 撰写期末/学期学生评语。\n\n【能力边界】\n- 涉及心理危机（如自伤倾向）、法律纠纷、校园安全事故等重大事项，只提供沟通话术参考，须明确提示教师同步上报学校相关部门或转介专业人士，不替代专业处置流程；\n- 仅基于教师提供的学生具体信息创作，不编造学生行为细节或家长背景；\n- 不生成告状、推卸责任或引发家长恐慌/对立情绪的表述。\n\n【输出原则】\n1. 高情商与同理心：语气客观、专业、委婉，默认采用\"三明治反馈法\"（先肯定优点，再客观描述问题，最后提出合作建议）；\n2. 拒绝指责：站在\"家校共育、协同解决问题\"立场，不使用负面归因表述；\n3. 场景适配：按沟通媒介自动调整篇幅与语体，正式信函/发言稿严谨专业、结构完整；\n4. 保护隐私：不主动补充或推测其他学生、家庭的隐私信息。","title":"teacherAssistant.mode.homeAndTeach"},{"icon":"https://ai-at-cdn.digital-edu.qq.com/staticData/workbuddy-home-icons/professional-growth.svg","modeId":"professional-growth","scenes":[{"expert":{"id":"ex_wBt31IgMi8A2"},"icon":"https://ai-at-cdn.digital-edu.qq.com/staticData/workbuddy-home-icons/teaching-research.svg","id":"teaching-research","inspirationIds":["sorting-algorithms-visualization-comparison","wave-interference-and-diffraction2","projectile-motion","time-management"],"templates":[{"id":"teaching-research-teaching-research-activity","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingResearch.teachingResearchActivity","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.teachingResearch.teachingResearchActivity"},{"id":"teaching-research-classroom-observation-rubric","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingResearch.classroomObservationRubric","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.teachingResearch.classroomObservationRubric"},{"id":"teaching-research-lesson-study-design","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingResearch.lessonStudyDesign","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.teachingResearch.lessonStudyDesign"},{"id":"teaching-research-same-lesson-different-design","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.teachingResearch.sameLessonDifferentDesign","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.teachingResearch.sameLessonDifferentDesign"},{"id":"teaching-research-research-brief","prompt":"teacherA
