y-home-icons/open-class-design.svg","id":"open-class-design","templates":[{"id":"open-class-design-regular-lesson-upgrade","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.openClassDesign.regularLessonUpgrade","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.openClassDesign.regularLessonUpgrade"},{"id":"open-class-design-highlight-session-design","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.openClassDesign.highlightSessionDesign","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.openClassDesign.highlightSessionDesign"},{"id":"open-class-design-lesson-presentation-script","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.openClassDesign.lessonPresentationScript","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.openClassDesign.lessonPresentationScript"},{"id":"open-class-design-competition-standard-alignment","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.openClassDesign.competitionStandardAlignment","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.openClassDesign.competitionStandardAlignment"},{"id":"open-class-design-teaching-rehearsal-review","prompt":"teacherAssistant.prompt.openClassDesign.teachingRehearsalReview","title":"teacherAssistant.tpl.openClassDesign.teachingRehearsalReview"}],"title":"teacherAssistant.scene.openClassDesign"}],"systemPromptAppend":"【角色定位】\n你是深谙教育理论的教研专家与教师职业发展导师，熟悉职称评审、课题研究、教学竞赛路径。\n\n【核心任务】\n协助教师完成案头材料与教研工作，包括但不限于：\n1. 撰写教学反思与听课评课稿；\n2. 撰写学期/学年工作总结；\n3. 规划教研论文大纲与逻辑框架；\n4. 梳理课题申报书的研究背景、意义、方案设计等逻辑链条。\n\n【能力边界】\n- 提供的是写作框架、逻辑梳理与语言润色，具体教学数据/案例/调研结果需教师提供真实素材，不得编造实验数据、引用文献或获奖信息；\n- 涉及职称评审、课题申报等有明确格式要求的正式材料，需提示教师核对所在地区/机构的官方模板；\n- 不代写存在学术不端风险（伪造成果、抄袭）的内容。\n\n【输出原则】\n1. 专业拔高：准确融入教育学/心理学术语（核心素养、支架式教学、大概念、最近发展区），提升理论深度但不堆砌术语影响可读性；\n2. 逻辑严密：使用规范小标题、编号与公文/学术排版格式，论证链条完整（现状—问题—对策/理论—实践—反思）；\n3. 拒绝套话：主动引导教师补充具体经验与真实数据，转化为有理论支撑的成果，避免假大空表述。","title":"teacherAssistant.mode.professional"}]}},"id":"home","order":10,"target":"builtin:new_task","title":"teacherAssistant.home.title"},{"children":[{"id":"experts","order":10,"target":"builtin:experts","title":"unifiedMarket.tab.experts"},{"id":"skills","order":20,"target":"builtin:skills","title":"unifiedMarket.tab.skills"},{"id":"connector