��其他可用工具更有利于完成任务，可组合使用其他 Skill、专家、连接器、文件和工具。始终以准确、高效、可验证地完成用户问题和任务为最高优先级，不为调用资产而调用，也不因首选资产失败而停止；对关键事实、数字和时点保留来源与口径，资料不足时明确说明缺口。当前为公司研究模式，优先由 Alpha派股票研究员及匹配的公司速览、盈利预测、公司估值、同业比较、投资逻辑、策略分析、财报分析、涨跌归因 Skill 处理；涉及结构化查数时可配合 Alpha派金融数据分析师。先确认公司全称、证券代码、上市市场和研究截止日；以正式披露为事实基线，结构化数据用于历史与横向比较，预测和估值必须展示假设、期间和单位。","title":"pai.mode.company-research"},{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Buildings/community-line.svg","modeId":"industry-theme","scenes":[{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Map/compass-discover-line.svg","id":"theme-stage","skills":[{"id":"skill_2092298284119617536","source":"builtin"}],"templates":[{"id":"theme-stage-discovery","prompt":"今天新增了哪些热点题材，其中\"固态电池\"\"可控核聚变\"哪些是新逻辑、哪些只是旧题材换名字？","title":"pai.template.theme-stage-discovery"},{"id":"theme-stage-classify","prompt":"当前市场最核心的一到三条主线是什么，AI 算力、创新药出海还是并购重组？","title":"pai.template.theme-stage-classify"},{"id":"theme-stage-breadth","prompt":"哪些题材同时出现新闻催化、成交放大和上涨家数扩散（如稳定币、机器人灵巧手）？","title":"pai.template.theme-stage-breadth"},{"id":"theme-stage-fundamentals","prompt":"隔夜英伟达和台积电行情，可能映射出哪些新的 A 股算力或先进封装题材？","title":"pai.template.theme-stage-fundamentals"},{"id":"theme-stage-next","prompt":"最近三天哪些题材（如 PCB、液冷、脑机接口）的关注度和讨论热度上升最快？","title":"pai.template.theme-stage-next"}],"title":"pai.scene.theme-stage"},{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Map/route-line.svg","id":"theme-cycle","skills":[{"id":"skill_2092298107925295104","source":"builtin"}],"templates":[{"id":"theme-cycle-cpo","prompt":"CPO 光模块题材当前处于发现、发酵、一致还是分歧退潮阶段？","title":"pai.template.theme-cycle-cpo"},{"id":"theme-cycle-robotics","prompt":"机器人（灵巧手/丝杠）这轮是题材第一次启动，还是调整后的二波行情？","title":"pai.template.theme-cycle-robotics"},{"id":"theme-cycle-biotech","prompt":"当前创新药行情是少数龙头领涨，还是已经扩散到二线 Biotech 和补涨标的？","title":"pai.template.theme-cycle-biotech"},{"id":"theme-cycle-solid-state","prompt":"固态电池题材的持续性由哪些条件支撑，目前这些条件还成立吗？","title":"pai.template.theme-cycle-solid-state"},{"id":"theme-cycle-compute","prompt":"与 2023 年 AI 行情相比，本轮算力题材大致走到哪个阶段？下一步是扩散还是切换？","title":"pai.template.theme-cycle-compute"}],"title":"pai.scene.theme-cycle"},{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Development/git-branch-line.svg","id":"value-chain-analysis","skills":[{"id":"skill_2092298758680248320","source":"builtin"}],"templates":[{"id":"value-chain-solar","prompt":"反内卷/供给侧政策会影响光伏产业链的哪些上中下游环节？谁受益、谁受损？","title":"pai.template.value-chain-solar"},{"id":"value-chain-lithium","prompt":"碳酸锂涨价后，锂电产业链哪些环节能保留利润，哪些会被成本挤压？","title":"pai.template.value-chain-lithium"},{"id":"value-chain-gb200","prompt":"英伟达 GB200 放量对国内 AI 服务器、铜连接、液冷产业链的传导路径是什么？","title":"pai.template.value-chain-gb200"},{"id":"value-chain-license-out","prompt":"创新药 License-out 事件是一次性利润贡献，还是可能改变公司中长期盈利中枢？","title":"pai.template.value-chain-license-out"},{"id":"value-chain-second-order","prompt":"一阶受益的算力链之外，先进封装、HBM、电源等二阶受益方向还有哪些容易被忽略？","title":"pai.template.value-chain-second-order"}],"title":"pai.scene.value-chain-analysis"},{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Document/file-search-line.svg","id":"beneficiary-screening","skills":[{"id":"skill_2092300913303777280","source":"builtin"}],"templates":[{"id":"beneficiary-screening-exposure","prompt":"围绕\"AI 眼镜\"主题，筛选真正具备光学、SoC 或整机订单暴露的 A 股公司。","title":"pai.template.beneficiary-screening-exposure"},{"id":"beneficiary-screening-tiers","prompt":"围绕\"固态电池\"，区分直接受益（材料/设备）、间接受益、预期受益和仅概念相关的标的。","title":"pai.template.beneficiary-screening-tiers"},{"id":"beneficiary-screening-bear","prompt":"围绕\"机器人灵巧手\"，给出候选公司的验证指标、主要风险和退出候选池的条件。","title":"pai.template.beneficiary-screening-bear"},{"id":"beneficiary-screening-compare","prompt":"围绕\"低空经济\"，哪些公司有实际 eVTOL 或空管系统订单而非蹭概念？","title":"pai.template.beneficiary-screening-compare"},{"id":"beneficiary-screening-chain","prompt":"围绕\"AI 算力电源（HVDC）\"，筛选真正进入英伟达或超大厂供应链的 A 股标的。","title":"pai.template.beneficiary-screening-chain"}],"title":"pai.scene.beneficiary-screening"},{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Document/booklet-line.svg","id":"industry-fundamentals","skills":[{"id":"skill_2092300683168649216","source":"builtin"}],"templates":[{"id":"industry-fundamentals-chain","prompt":"给我一张 PCB 行业一页纸，覆盖上中下游环节、价值量分配和主要玩家。","title":"pai.template.industry-fundamentals-chain"},{"id":"industry-fundamentals-model","prompt":"光模块行业的上游（光芯片/激光器）、中游（模块）、下游（云厂）分别有哪些环节，投入产出是什么？","title":"pai.template.industry-fundamentals-model"},{"id":"industry-fundamentals-profit","prompt":"一台工业机器人的成本和价值量如何分配到减速器、伺服、控制器等环节？","title":"pai.template.industry-fundamentals-profit"},{"id":"industry-fundamentals-competition","prompt":"CXO 行业各环节有哪些主要厂商，当前市占率和集中度是多少？","title":"pai.template.industry-fundamentals-competition"},{"id":"industry-fundamentals-valuation","prompt":"检测认证行业的进入壁垒是什么，新进入者需要多长时间才能形成有效供给？","title":"pai.template.industry-fundamentals-valuation"}],"title":"pai.scene.industry-fundamentals"},{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Design/clockwise-2-line.svg","id":"cycle-technology","skills":[{"id":"skill_2092296752573464576","source":"builtin"}],"templates":[{"id":"cycle-technology-stage","prompt":"面板行业当前处于周期的哪个阶段，判断依据是什么（价格、稼动率、库存）？","title":"pai.template.cycle-technology-stage"},{"id":"cycle-technology-routes","prompt":"存储（DRAM/NAND）本轮周期与上一轮相比，驱动因素和供给约束有什么不同？","title":"pai.template.cycle-technology-routes"},{"id":"cycle-technology-leading","prompt":"生猪养殖行业哪些领先指标通常先于收入、利润和股价出现变化？","title":"pai.template.cycle-technology-leading"},{"id":"cycle-technology-bottleneck","prompt":"光伏行业产能出清是否接近尾声，可以用哪些数据（开工率、价格、亏损面）验证？","title":"pai.template.cycle-technology-bottleneck"},{"id":"cycle-technology-commercialization","prompt":"航运（集运/干散）下一轮向上或向下拐点最可能在什么时间窗口出现？","title":"pai.template.cycle-technology-commercialization"}],"title":"pai.scene.cycle-technology"},{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Health%20%26%20Medical/microscope-line.svg","id":"technology-routes","skills":[{"id":"skill_2092298065968455680","source":"builtin"}],"templates":[{"id":"technology-routes-battery","prompt":"电池行业目前有哪些主流和潜在技术路线（磷酸铁锂、三元、固态、钠电），原理和差异是什么？","title":"pai.template.technology-routes-battery"},{"id":"technology-routes-optical","prompt":"光模块从可插拔到 CPO/LPO，各路线在功耗、成本和量产难度上有什么差异？","title":"pai.template.technology-routes-optical"},{"id":"technology-routes-packaging","prompt":"先进封装 2.5D/3D、CoWoS 与国内 Chiplet 路线，当前份额和主要应用场景是什么？","title":"pai.template.technology-routes-packaging"},{"id":"technology-routes-sic","prompt":"功率半导体 SiC 相比 IGBT，最难突破的材料、设备和良率瓶颈是什么？","title":"pai.template.technology-routes-sic"},{"id":"technology-routes-perovskite","prompt":"应跟踪哪些客户认证、良率和成本信号来验证钙钛矿电池路线的商业化落地？","title":"pai.template.technology-routes-perovskite"}],"title":"pai.scene.technology-routes"},{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Buildings/government-line.svg","id":"policy-global","skills":[{"id":"skill_2092297339788496896","source":"builtin"}],"templates":[{"id":"policy-global-change","prompt":"光伏\"反内卷\"限产新规相比原有制度具体改变了哪些条款，约束和受支持对象分别是谁？","title":"pai.template.policy-global-change"},{"id":"policy-global-transmission","prompt":"创新药医保谈判和商保创新药目录会通过什么路径影响 Biotech 的需求和盈利？","title":"pai.template.policy-global-transmission"},{"id":"policy-global-comparison","prompt":"医疗设备集采/以旧换新政策会如何改变行业竞争格局和集中度？","title":"pai.template.policy-global-comparison"},{"id":"policy-global-localization","prompt":"数据要素/数据资产入表政策是否已正式落地，执行时间、范围和地方差异是什么？","title":"pai.template.policy-global-localization"},{"id":"policy-global-scenarios","prompt":"后续应跟踪哪些官方文件和执行数据，来验证半导体设备国产化政策的真实影响？","title":"pai.template.policy-global-scenarios"}],"title":"pai.scene.policy-global"},{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Map/globe-line.svg","id":"global-industry","skills":[{"id":"skill_2092295787874234368","source":"builtin"}],"templates":[{"id":"global-industry-solar","prompt":"光伏行业全球市场规模及中国、美国、欧洲的份额分别是多少，中国份额还能提升吗？","title":"pai.template.global-industry-solar"},{"id":"global-industry-biotech","prompt":"创新药国内与海外（如 MNC）产业链结构、商业模式和利润分配有什么不同？","title":"pai.template.global-industry-biotech"},{"id":"global-industry-localization","prompt":"光刻机、量测设备等环节国内哪些已实现国产替代，哪些仍高度依赖进口？","title":"pai.template.global-industry-localization"},{"id":"global-industry-barriers","prompt":"半导体设备尚未国产替代的核心障碍是技术、材料、专利还是客户验证？","title":"pai.template.global-industry-barriers"},{"id":"global-industry-supply-chain","prompt":"出口管制和关税变化会如何重构 AI 算力全球供应链与国内替代节奏？","title":"pai.template.global-industry-supply-chain"}],"title":"pai.scene.global-industry"},{"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.0/icons/Document/folder-chart-2-line.svg","id":"industry-valuation","skills":[{"id":"skill_2092297381718953984","source":"builtin"}],"templates":[{"id":"industry-valuation-cxo","prompt":"CXO 行业应该采用 PE、PS、EV/EBITDA 还是其他估值方法？当前处于历史什么分位？","title":"pai.template.industry-valuation-cxo"},{"id":"industry-valuation-equipment","prompt":"半导体设备行业在 A 股与海外（ASML、AMAT）的估值差异有多大，原因是什么？","title":"pai.template.industry-valuation-equipment"},{"id":"industry-valuation-hog","prompt":"生猪养殖周期底部亏损时，应该如何估算行业合理价值？","title":"pai.template.industry-valuation-hog"},{"id":"industry-valuation-optical","prompt":"当前光模块板块估值隐含了怎样的出货量、价格和增长预期？","title":"pai.template.industry-valuation-optical"},{"id":"industry-valuation-biotech","prompt":"帮我把创新药行业分成核心龙头、弹性标的、观察标的三层研究清单并说明分类依据。","title":"pai.template.industry-valuation-biotech"}],"title":"pai.scene.industry-valuation"}],"systemPromptAppend":"你正在 Alpha派 Buddy 中工作。Alpha派是讯兔科技面向金融从业者与投资者打造的 AI 投研品牌，本 WorkBuddy 版本面向个人用户，覆盖市场、公司、行业、主题、基金、美股与金融数据研究。执行任务时先判断所需的方法、角色与数据：相关资产可用时，默认优先使用匹配的 Alpha派 Skill，由对应的 Alpha派专家承接专业任务；跨领域、深度研究或需要多角色协作时，可使用 Alpha派基本面深度研究专家团；需要公告、结构化金融数据、研究资料或会议纪要时，优先使用 Alpha派投研助手。以上是首选路径而非排他限制；若 Alpha派资产不可用、不适用，或其他可用工具更有利于完成任务，可组合使用其他 Skill、专家、连接器、文件和工具。始终以准确、高效、可验证地完成用户问题和任务为最高优先级，不为调用资产而调用，也不因首选资产失败而停止；对关键事实、数字和时点保留来源与口径，资料不足时明确说明缺口。当前为行业主题模式：主题发现、主题周期、产业链和主题选股优先由 Alpha派主题研究员处理；行业概览、行业周期、技术路线、产业政策、全球比较和行业估值优先由 Alpha派行业研究员处理，并使用匹配的 Alpha派 Skill。先定义行业或主题边界、地域和截止日；把热点叙事落实到供需、价格、库存、产能、技术、政策和公司业务暴露等可验证指标，并同时检查反证。","title":"pai.mode.industry-theme"},{"icon":"htt