atic@latest/icons/layers.svg","id":"multi-factor-fund-selection","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092973531610750976","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973531610750976"},{"id":"skill_2092923394724446208","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923394724446208"},{"id":"skill_2092973797113188352","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973797113188352"}],"systemPromptAppend":"基金与 ETF 的排名、收益、规模类筛选走 gfinfo-quote-rank 的榜单能力，涉及标的背景时用 gfinfo-secu-info 核实。工具无法覆盖的因子（如最大回撤、基金经理）要明确说明数据缺口，不得凭记忆补齐数值。","templates":[{"id":"multi-factor-fund-selection-p1","prompt":"请扫描最新交易日 ETF 成交额排名，列出成交额前 10 的产品，并展示产品名称、代码和成交额，看看当前市场交易最活跃的 ETF 有哪些。","title":"gf.template.multi-factor-fund-selection.p1"},{"id":"multi-factor-fund-selection-p2","prompt":"请查询最新交易日 ETF 涨幅排名前 10 的产品，并列出产品名称、代码和涨跌幅，帮助我了解当日表现较强的主题和指数方向。","title":"gf.template.multi-factor-fund-selection.p2"},{"id":"multi-factor-fund-selection-p3","prompt":"请查询最新交易日 ETF 换手率排名前 10 的产品，并展示产品名称、代码和换手率，看看哪些 ETF 当前交易热度较高。","title":"gf.template.multi-factor-fund-selection.p3"},{"id":"multi-factor-fund-selection-p4","prompt":"请查询最新交易日 ETF 资金净流入排名前 10 的产品，并列出产品名称、代码和资金净流入数据，帮助我了解资金正在关注哪些 ETF 方向。","title":"gf.template.multi-factor-fund-selection.p4"}],"title":"gf.scene.multiFactorFundSelection"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_uPeanttZLojJ"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/zap.svg","id":"event-driven-stock-picking","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092973531610750976","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973531610750976"},{"id":"skill_2092923394724446208","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923394724446208"},{"id":"skill_2092973797113188352","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973797113188352"}],"systemPromptAppend":"事件脉络先调用 gfinfo-hot-topic 获取专题摘要、事件脉络与关联文章，再用 gfinfo-industry-sector-analysis 补行业板块层面的资讯。受益标的必须有专题或板块资讯支撑，不得凭常识推演。","templates":[{"id":"event-driven-stock-picking-p1","prompt":"请围绕“xx行业”扫描近期热点专题，列出相关专题标题、事件摘要、关联栏目和最新文章，帮助我了解近期证券行业有哪些值得关注的事件。","title":"gf.template.event-driven-stock-picking.p1"},{"id":"event-driven-stock-picking-p2","prompt":"请查询“xxx”相关的热点专题，给出专题事件摘要、关联栏目、最新文章列表和最新进展，帮助我快速了解政策主题的演变情况。","title":"gf.template.event-driven-stock-picking.p2"},{"id":"event-driven-stock-picking-p3","prompt":"请围绕“ xxx”板块查询相关热点专题，梳理专题摘要、关联栏目和最新文章列表，并展示该主题近期的最新进展。","title":"gf.template.event-driven-stock-picking.p3"}],"title":"gf.scene.eventDrivenStockPicking"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_SowQ43KVJ1oP"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/flame.svg","id":"hot-topic-fund-selection","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092973531610750976","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973531610750976"},{"id":"skill_2092923394724446208","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923394724446208"},{"id":"skill_2092973797113188352","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973797113188352"}],"systemPromptAppend":"热点与主题热度来自 gfinfo-hot-topic，ETF 侧的异动与成因来自 gfinfo-etf-movers。把热点映射到 ETF 时须说明依据来自哪条资讯或哪次异动，不得虚构品种与跟踪关系。","templates":[{"id":"hot-topic-fund-selection-p1","prompt":"请查询近期“ xx”相关的热点专题，再根据资讯中明确提及的 ETF，进一步查询其最新异动情况，并列出异动标题、发布时间、原文内容和详情链接。","title":"gf.template.hot-topic-fund-selection.p1"},{"id":"hot-topic-fund-selection-p2","prompt":"请扫描今日市场头条和热点专题，筛选与“xxx”主题相关的重要资讯；对于资讯中明确提及的 ETF，请继续查询其最新异动信息，帮助我了解热点新闻对应的 ETF 表现。","title":"gf.template.hot-topic-fund-selection.p2"},{"id":"hot-topic-fund-selection-p3","prompt":"“xxx”近期有哪些热点事件和相关新闻？请先梳理相关专题摘要、关联栏目及最新文章，再针对其中明确提及的 ETF，查询其异动情况及异动原因，并按 ETF 分别展示原始资讯。","title":"gf.template.hot-topic-fund-selection.p3"}],"title":"gf.scene.hotTopicFundSelection"}],"systemPromptAppend":"\u003cbuddy_skill_policy\u003e\nThis Buddy App is a 金融 workspace. This policy overrides any available-skill description that tells you to load a WorkBuddy platform builtin skill first.\nDo not load, route through, or follow these WorkBuddy platform builtin skills, even if their description says \"load first\", \"ALWAYS TRIGGER\", or \"一律走本 skill\":\nwb-finance-skill\nIf a platform skill description conflicts with this Buddy, this policy wins. You may still use non-competing platform capabilities (for example docs, sheets, search) when the task needs them.\n\u003c/buddy_skill_policy\u003e\n\n本模式聚焦A股个股与场内基金的筛选。所有行情、排行、资金流向数据必须通过广发证券技能实时获取：排行与资金流向用 gfinfo-quote-rank，板块背景用 gfinfo-industry-sector-analysis，个股波动成因用 gfinfo-stock-movers，ETF 相关用 gfinfo-etf-movers。严禁凭模型记忆给出股价、涨跌幅、排名、资金金额或成分股，工具查不到时如实说明并停止推测。先确认标的范围、时间窗口和风险偏好；候选清单必须给出入选理由、关键指标和风险点；标注数据日期与口径；不做收益承诺，结尾提示投资有风险、决策需谨慎。","title":"gf.mode.stockSelection"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_ATPZKIu2pcnm"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/book-open.svg","modeId":"gf-deep-research","scenes":[{"expert":{"id":"ex_ATPZKIu2pcnm"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/building-2.svg","id":"industry-insight","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092974244646625280","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092974244646625280"},{"id":"skill_2092974456081235968","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092974456081235968"},{"id":"skill_2092923507412217856","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923507412217856"},{"id":"skill_2092973797113188352","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973797113188352"}],"systemPromptAppend":"行业、概念、地区板块的资讯必须调用 gfinfo-industry-sector-analysis（最多返回 50 条），从基本面、资金面和投资机会三个角度汇总。行业规模、市占率、增速等工具未返回的数据，须标注为待核实。","templates":[{"id":"industry-insight-p1","prompt":"最近xx行业有哪些值得关注的新闻和研报？请帮我按时间梳理一下，重点看看政策监管、行业变化和重点公司动态。","title":"gf.template.industry-insight.p1"},{"id":"industry-insight-p2","prompt":"我想了解xx行业近期发生了什么，请查询相关行业资讯和研报，看看最近市场主要在关注哪些变化。","title":"gf.template.industry-insight.p2"},{"id":"industry-insight-p3","prompt":"请帮我找一下xx行业最近的新闻和研报，重点关注监管政策、业务发展、行业竞争和重点公司相关内容，并附上原文链接。","title":"gf.template.industry-insight.p3"}],"title":"gf.scene.industryInsight"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_6I37boKQlVgq"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/candlestick-chart.svg","id":"stock-panorama","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092974244646625280","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092974244646625280"},{"id":"skill_2092974456081235968","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092974456081235968"},{"id":"skill_2092923507412217856","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923507412217856"},{"id":"skill_2092973797113188352","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973797113188352"}],"systemPromptAppend":"标准取数顺序：gfinfo-stock-news-summary 取近期资讯 → gfinfo-stock-report-summary 取研报观点 → gfinfo-secu-info 取公司资料与主营业务。三步缺一不可，缺失的部分要显式说明未获取到。","templates":[{"id":"stock-panorama-p1","prompt":"我想了解 xxx 公司的基本资料，请查询其公司全称、证券简称、上市板块、上市日期、主营业务和所属行业等信息。","title":"gf.template.stock-panorama.p1"},{"id":"stock-panorama-p2","prompt":"xxx 股票最近有什么重要变化？请查询其最新公司资料、近期新闻和异动信息，重点展示近期发布的内容及可能引起关注的事件；各类资讯请按照原始返回结果分别列示，不要自行补充或推测。","title":"gf.template.stock-panorama.p2"},{"id":"stock-panorama-p3","prompt":"最近准备关注 xxx 股票，想了解一下市场和机构都在关注什么。请同时查询该股票近期的新闻、券商研报和异动资讯，分别列出标题、发布时间、来源、摘要或原文内容及详情链接。","title":"gf.template.stock-panorama.p3"}],"title":"gf.scene.stockPanorama"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_SowQ43KVJ1oP"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/pie-chart.svg","id":"fund-diagnosis","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092974244646625280","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092974244646625280"},{"id":"skill_2092974456081235968","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092974456081235968"},{"id":"skill_2092923507412217856","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923507412217856"},{"id":"skill_2092973797113188352","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973797113188352"}],"systemPromptAppend":"ETF 异动与成因调用 gfinfo-etf-movers。只做要素梳理与风险提示，不给出买卖建议。","templates":[{"id":"fund-diagnosis-p1","prompt":"我想了解一下 xxx ETF 最近的表现，近期有没有明显异动？请查询相关异动资讯，并列出异动时间、标题、内容和详情链接。","title":"gf.template.fund-diagnosis.p1"},{"id":"fund-diagnosis-p2","prompt":"xxx ETF 最近为什么出现上涨或下跌？请帮我查询相关异动资讯和原文中提到的异动原因，不需要额外推测。","title":"gf.template.fund-diagnosis.p2"},{"id":"fund-diagnosis-p3","prompt":"最近市场上哪些 ETF 成交比较活跃、涨幅靠前或资金净流入较多？请分别列出对应榜单，展示产品名称、代码和相关排行数据。","title":"gf.template.fund-diagnosis.p3"}],"title":"gf.scene.fundDiagnosis"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_6I37boKQlVgq"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/newspaper.svg","id":"news-digest","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092974244646625280","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092974244646625280"},{"id":"skill_2092974456081235968","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092974456081235968"},{"id":"skill_2092923507412217856","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923507412217856"},{"id":"skill_2092973797113188352","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973797113188352"}],"systemPromptAppend":"个股与板块资讯必须调用 gfinfo-stock-news-summary 获取（最多 50 条），汇总提炼核心观点与投资逻辑。每条结论都要能追溯到工具返回的原文，标注来源与时间，不得合并改写成无出处的判断。","templates":[{"id":"news-digest-p1","prompt":"xxx 股票最近有什么新消息？请帮我快速浏览近期新闻，列出标题、发布时间、媒体来源和详情链接。","title":"gf.template.news-digest.p1"},{"id":"news-digest-p2","prompt":"今天市场上有哪些重要新闻和热门话题？请帮我整理今日市场头条和热点专题，展示相关摘要及文章链接。","title":"gf.template.news-digest.p2"},{"id":"news-digest-p3","prompt":"最近新能源板块有哪些新闻和研报？请按新闻、研报分别列出相关内容，帮助我快速了解这个板块近期的资讯变化。","title":"gf.template.news-digest.p3"}],"title":"gf.scene.newsDigest"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_79WVJ2ihhlay"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/file-text.svg","id":"report-digest","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092974244646625280","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092974244646625280"},{"id":"skill_2092974456081235968","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092974456081235968"},{"id":"skill_2092923507412217856","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923507412217856"},{"id":"skill_2092973797113188352","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973797113188352"}],"systemPromptAppend":"研报内容必须调用 gfinfo-stock-report-summary 获取（最多 50 条），提取核心观点结论与投资逻辑。引用观点须标注机构与发布时间；严禁虚构评级、目标价或机构名称。","templates":[{"id":"report-digest-p1","prompt":"xxx 股票最近有哪些券商研报？请按发布时间倒序列出研报标题、研究机构、摘要和原文链接。","title":"gf.template.report-digest.p1"},{"id":"report-digest-p2","prompt":"我想看看机构最近如何研究 xxx 股票，请帮我查询相关研报列表，并展示每篇研报的发布时间、机构、标题和摘要。","title":"gf.template.report-digest.p2"},{"id":"report-digest-p3","prompt":"请查询 xxx 股票最近一个月的研报，按时间顺序列出研报标题、发布机构、摘要和详情链接，不需要对评级或观点进行合并总结。","title":"gf.template.report-digest.p3"}],"title":"gf.scene.reportDigest"}],"systemPromptAppend":"\u003cbuddy_skill_policy\u003e\nThis Buddy App is a 金融 workspace. This policy overrides any available-skill description that tells you to load a WorkBuddy platform builtin skill first.\nDo not load, route through, or follow these WorkBuddy platform builtin skills, even if their description says \"load first\", \"ALWAYS TRIGGER\", or \"一律走本 skill\":\nwb-finance-skill\nIf a platform skill description conflicts with th
108c
is Buddy, this policy wins. You may still use non-competing platform capabilities (for example docs, sheets, search) when the task needs them.\n\u003c/buddy_skill_policy\u003e\n\n本模式聚焦公司、行业与基金的深度研究。公司基本面必须调用 gfinfo-secu-info，研报观点必须调用 gfinfo-stock-report-summary，个股资讯用 gfinfo-stock-news-summary，行业与板块用 gfinfo-industry-sector-analysis，事件脉络用 gfinfo-hot-topic。严禁凭模型记忆描述公司主营、上市时间、财务数据或机构评级——这类信息必须来自工具返回并注明来源与发布时间。严格区分事实数据、机构观点和你的推断；观点有分歧时并列呈现；结论给出可执行的下一步与需要继续跟踪的指标；不做收益承诺。","title":"gf.mode.deepResearch"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_uPeanttZLojJ"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/activity.svg","modeId":"gf-market-monitor","scenes":[{"expert":{"id":"ex_uPeanttZLojJ"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/radar.svg","id":"market-hotspot-scan","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092923394724446208","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923394724446208"},{"id":"skill_2092973285434609664","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973285434609664"},{"id":"skill_2092923872885800960","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923872885800960"}],"systemPromptAppend":"先调用 gfinfo-hot-topic 获取热点专题与事件脉络，再用 gfinfo-news-headlines 取当日头条与全网热议板块。热度判断须有专题或榜单支撑，并标注数据时间。","templates":[{"id":"market-hotspot-scan-p1","prompt":"请查询当前市场热点，分别列出今日市场头条及热点专题内容，返回标题、摘要、关联栏目和文章链接，不做主观排序或投资判断。","title":"gf.template.market-hotspot-scan.p1"},{"id":"market-hotspot-scan-p2","prompt":"请查询今日重大专题事件，返回专题标题、事件摘要、关联栏目、相关文章及最新进展，按接口返回内容客观展示。","title":"gf.template.market-hotspot-scan.p2"},{"id":"market-hotspot-scan-p3","prompt":"请查询新能源板块最新资讯，梳理热点以及事件脉络","title":"gf.template.market-hotspot-scan.p3"}],"title":"gf.scene.marketHotspotScan"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_mfDndaSgFUzh"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/activity.svg","id":"intraday-movers-monitor","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092923394724446208","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923394724446208"},{"id":"skill_2092973285434609664","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973285434609664"},{"id":"skill_2092923872885800960","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923872885800960"}],"systemPromptAppend":"个股异动调用 gfinfo-stock-movers，ETF 异动调用 gfinfo-etf-movers。异动成因只能引用工具返回的解释，区分公告驱动、板块联动与资金行为，并标注异动发生时间。","templates":[{"id":"intraday-movers-monitor-p1","prompt":"请查询 XX 股票今日的异动资讯，并按原始内容返回异动标题、发布时间、异动说明及详情链接。","title":"gf.template.intraday-movers-monitor.p1"},{"id":"intraday-movers-monitor-p2","prompt":"请查询 XX ETF（如 510300.SH）的异动资讯，并按原始内容返回异动标题、发布时间、异动说明及详情链接。","title":"gf.template.intraday-movers-monitor.p2"},{"id":"intraday-movers-monitor-p3","prompt":"今日盘面有哪些异动？输出包含股票及 etf 异动的综合解读信息给我。","title":"gf.template.intraday-movers-monitor.p3"}],"title":"gf.scene.intradayMoversMonitor"},{"expert":{"id":"ex_H9TulpsHo3fu"},"icon":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@latest/icons/calendar-clock.svg","id":"scheduled-report","inspirationIds":[],"skills":[{"id":"skill_2092923394724446208","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923394724446208"},{"id":"skill_2092973285434609664","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092973285434609664"},{"id":"skill_2092923872885800960","source":"builtin","sourceId":"skill_2092923872885800960"}],"systemPromptAppend"
73d4
:"盘面简报的内容必须调用 gfinfo-market-comment 获取（涵盖盘前点评、午间点评、收盘点评，支持按日期，近三月内）。简报须标注生成时间与对应交易时段，结构固定为：盘面概况、主导板块、资金特征、后市关注点。若当前时段的点评尚未发布，明确说明数据未更新，不得用历史数据冒充当日内容。","templates":[{"id":"scheduled-report-p1","prompt":"请查询今日市场早报，完整展示相关点评内容，帮助我快速了解开盘前的重要市场资讯。","title":"gf.template.scheduled-report.p1"},{"id":"scheduled-report-p2","prompt":"请查询今日市场午间点评，完整展示相关点评内容，帮助我了解午盘市场表现和当日盘中信息。","title":"gf.template.scheduled-report.p2"},{"id":"scheduled-report-p3","prompt":"请查询今日市场收盘点评，完整展示相关点评内容，帮助我了解今日市场收盘表现及相关市场信息。","title":"gf.template.scheduled-report.p3"}],"title":"gf.scene.scheduledReport"}],"systemPromptAppend":"\u003cbuddy_skill_policy\u003e\nThis Buddy App is a 金融 workspace. This policy overrides any available-skill description that tells you to load a WorkBuddy platform builtin skill first.\nDo not load, route through, or follow these WorkBuddy platform builtin skills, even if their description says \"load first\", \"ALWAYS TRIGGER\", or \"一律走本 skill\":\nwb-finance-skill\nIf a platform skill description conflicts with this Buddy, this policy wins. You may still use non-competing platform capabilities (for example docs, sheets, search) when the task needs them.\n\u003c/buddy_skill_policy\u003e\n\n本模式聚焦盘中与盘后的实时市场跟踪，对数据时效性要求最高。市场热点必须调用 gfinfo-news-headlines，异动成因必须调用 gfinfo-stock-movers 或 gfinfo-etf-movers，盘面复盘用 gfinfo-market-comment，榜单与资金用 gfinfo-quote-rank，事件节奏用 gfinfo-investment-calendar。任何行情数字都不得凭记忆给出。回答须标注数据时间戳和所处交易时段（盘前、盘中、盘后）；先给结构化榜单与异动信息，再做简短解读；异动原因区分已确认公告、公开资讯和市场传闻；保持简洁可扫读，并提示行情数据存在延迟可能。","title":"gf.mode.marketMonitor"}]}},"id":"home","order":10,"target":"builtin:new_task","title":"gf.nav.home"},{"children":[{"id":"experts","order":10,"target":"builtin:experts","title":"gf.nav.experts"},{"id":"skills","order":20,"target":"builtin:skills","title":"gf.nav.skills"},{"id":"connectors","order":30,"target":"builtin:connectors","title":"gf.nav.connectors"}],"id":"market","order":30,"target":"builtin:experts","title":"gf.nav.market"},{"id":"automation","order":60,"target":"builtin:automation","title":"gf.nav.automation"},{"id":"space","order":70,"target":"builtin:space","title":"gf.nav.knowledge"},{"children":[{"id":"inspiration","order":50,"target":"builtin:inspiration","title":"gf.nav.inspiration"},{"id":"my-files","order":10,"target":"builtin:my_files","title":"gf.nav.myFiles"}],"id":"more","order":9000,"target":"builtin:more","title":"gf.nav.more"}]}},"version":1},"priority":880,"operation_tag":{"title":"","description":""},"allowed_redirect_uris_json":"[\"https://mcp-api.gf.com.cn/oauth/authorize\"]","allowed_origins_json":"[\"https://hd.gf.com.cn\",\"https://hdtest.gf.com.cn\",\"http://localhost:8080\"]"},{"application_id":"cb_fFRkiFQtmMCWtmSJOYrE","application_name":"腾讯公益智能助手","description":"公益机构的AI搭子","version_no":2,"application_template_config":{"authConfig":{"capabilityDescription":"腾讯公益智能助手","skipJump":false},"brand":{"logo":"https://orgcdn.gongyi.qq.com/wb/gywb128.svg","title":"brand.title"},"i18n":{"defaultLocale":"zh-CN","fallbackLocale":"zh-CN","source":{"zh-CN":{"brand.title":"腾讯公益智能助手","home.chatInput.placeholder":"今天帮你做些什么？","home.header.title":"腾讯公益智能助手","home.modes.gongyi-business.title":"腾讯公益业务","home.modes.gongyi-content.title":"公益文书","home.modes.gongyi-project-tools.title":"智能工具","home.scenes.gongyi-business-handle-todo.templates.handle-todo-platform.prompt":"帮我检查，本机构在腾讯公益平台有哪些待办要完成","home.scenes.gongyi-business-handle-todo.templates.handle-todo-platform.title":"处理平台待办","home.scenes.gongyi-business-handle-todo.templates.handle-todo-reply.prompt":"帮我查询一下近30天的捐赠人留言，输出回复建议","home.scenes.gongyi-business-handle-todo.templates.handle-todo-reply.title":"回复捐赠人留言","home.scenes.gongyi-business-handle-todo.templates.handle-todo-update-record.prompt":"帮我检查即将逾期的备案号列表，我提供截图进行更新","home.scenes.gongyi-business-handle-todo.templates.handle-todo-update-record.title":"更新备案号","home.scenes.gongyi-business-handle-todo.templates.handle-todo-upload.prompt":"我会提交捐赠票据，你帮我找到对应的申请人并上传到平台","home.scenes.gongyi-business-handle-todo.templates.handle-todo-upload.title":"上传捐赠票据","home.scenes.gongyi-business-handle-todo.title":"处理待办","home.scenes.gongyi-business-jiujiu-report.templates.jiujiu-report-daily-good-deeds.prompt":"帮我生成一份【统计时间】的好事战报","home.scenes.gongyi-business-jiujiu-report.templates.jiujiu-report-daily-good-deeds.title":"日常好事战报","home.scenes.gongyi-business-jiujiu-report.templates.jiujiu-report-good-deeds.prompt":"帮我生成一份久久好事战报","home.scenes.gongyi-business-jiujiu-report.templates.jiujiu-report-good-deeds.title":"久久好事战报","home.scenes.gongyi-business-jiujiu-report.title":"久久爱心战报","home.scenes.gongyi-business-org-work-summary.templates.org-work-summary-14days.prompt":"生成本机构最近14天的工作小结报告","home.scenes.gongyi-business-org-work-summary.templates.org-work-summary-14days.title":"近14天工作小结","home.scenes.gongyi-business-org-work-summary.templates.org-work-summary-2months.prompt":"生成本机构近2个月的工作小结报告","home.scenes.gongyi-business-org-work-summary.templates.org-work-summary-2months.title":"近2个月工作小结","home.scenes.gongyi-business-org-work-summary.templates.org-work-summary-lastmonth.prompt":"生成本机构上个月的工作小结报告","home.scenes.gongyi-business-org-work-summary.templates.org-work-summary-lastmonth.title":"上月工作小结","home.scenes.gongyi-business-org-work-summary.templates.org-work-summary-week.prompt":"生成本机构最近7天的工作小结报告","home.scenes.gongyi-business-org-work-summary.templates.org-work-summary-week.title":"近7天工作小结","home.scenes.gongyi-business-org-work-summary.title":"生成工作小结","home.scenes.gongyi-business-platform-rule-consult.templates.platform-rule-fundraising-resume.prompt":"项目显示暂停筹款，如何才能恢复筹款？","home.scenes.gongyi-business-platform-rule-consult.templates.platform-rule-fundraising-resume.title":"项目恢复筹款","home.scenes.gongyi-business-platform-rule-consult.templates.platform-rule-monthly-donation.prompt":"项目如何升级月捐，有操作指引吗？","home.scenes.gongyi-business-platform-rule-consult.templates.platform-rule-monthly-donation.title":"开通月捐门槛","home.scenes.gongyi-business-platform-rule-consult.templates.platform-rule-record-review.prompt":"备案号提交修改后，需要审核多久？","home.scenes.gongyi-business-platform-rule-consult.templates.platform-rule-record-review.title":"备案号审核时长","home.scenes.gongyi-business-platform-rule-consult.templates.platform-rule-reply-message.prompt":"用户留言如何回复？遇到高风险留言应该如何处理","home.scenes.gongyi-business-platform-rule-consult.templates.platform-rule-reply-message.title":"回复用户留言","home.scenes.gongyi-business-platform-rule-consult.title":"查询平台规则","home.scenes.gongyi-content-copywriting-polish.templates.copywriting-polish-community.prompt":"我要润色一段发到微信群的项目播报或劝募消息。请你让信息更直接、关键点更突出、行动号召更明确，但保留群消息应有的亲切和简洁，不要营销腔，原文如下：【社群消息草稿】。","home.scenes.gongyi-content-copywriting-polish.templates.copywriting-polish-community.title":"润色社群消息","home.scenes.gongyi-content-copywriting-polish.templates.copywriting-polish-moments.prompt":"我要润色一段朋友圈文案，请你把它压得更短、节奏更紧、用个人视角讲出更有冲击力的话，克制不煽情，避免硬广感。原稿如下：【朋友圈文案】。","home.scenes.gongyi-content-copywriting-polish.templates.copywriting-polish-moments.title":"润色朋友圈文案","home.scenes.gongyi-content-copywriting-polish.templates.copywriting-polish-official-account.prompt":"我要润色一篇公众号推文，请你保持原文的事实准确与温暖底色，让叙事更有层次、情绪推进更自然、关键信息更突出、结尾呼吁更有力。原稿如下：【公众号文案/文档】","home.scenes.gongyi-content-copywriting-polish.templates.copywriting-polish-official-account.title":"润色公众号文案","home.scenes.gongyi-content-copywriting-polish.templates.copywriting-polish-xiaohongshu.prompt":"我要润色一段小红书笔记，请你按小红书的阅读习惯调一下：合理分段、加 Emoji 节奏、关键信息加粗、结尾带一个互动话题标签，语气亲切、像真人分享，原稿如下：【小红书文案/文档】。","home.scenes.gongyi-content-copywriting-polish.templates.copywriting-polish-xiaohongshu.title":"润色小红书文案","home.scenes.gongyi-content-copywriting-polish.title":"润色文案","home.scenes.gongyi-content-event-article-writing.templates.event-article-writing-community.prompt":"我要根据【项目名称】的执行进展，总结一段劝募文案发到微信群里","home.scenes.gongyi-content-event-article-writing.templates.event-article-writing-community.title":"写社群消息","home.scenes.gongyi-content-event-article-writing.templates.event-article-writing-moments.prompt":"我要根据【项目名称】的执行进展，写一段劝募文案发到朋友圈，文字精简有感染力","home.scenes.gongyi-content-event-article-writing.templates.event-article-writing-moments.title":"发朋友圈","home.scenes.gongyi-content-event-article-writing.templates.event-article-writing-official-account.prompt":"我要根据【项目名称】的执行进展，撰写一篇公众号推文，文风温暖，需要突出受益人的真实变化","home.scenes.gongyi-content-event-article-writing.templates.event-article-writing-official-account.title":"写公众号","home.scenes.gongyi-content-event-article-writing.templates.event-article-writing-xiaohongshu.prompt":"我要根据【项目名称】的执行进展，写一篇小红书风格的推文","home.scenes.gongyi-content-event-article-writing.templates.event-article-writing-xiaohongshu.title":"写小红书","home.scenes.gongyi-content-event-article-writing.title":"撰写活动推文","home.scenes.gongyi-content-funding-application-writing.templates.funding-application-writing-condition.prompt":"附件是资助方发布的申报公告，请评估我机构是否符合申报条件，并梳理申报要点。","home.scenes.gongyi-content-funding-application-writing.templates.funding-application-writing-condition.title":"判断资助资格","home.scenes.gongyi-content-funding-application-writing.templates.funding-application-writing-draft.prompt":"这是我想申报的资助项目通知，请帮我解析要求并完成申请表填报：【粘贴通知链接】","home.scenes.gongyi-content-funding-application-writing.templates.funding-application-writing-draft.title":"解析资助要求","home.scenes.gongyi-content-funding-application-writing.templates.funding-application-writing-final-report.prompt":"通知要求自行编制项目申报书，没有模板，请根据通知要求帮我起草一份","home.scenes.gongyi-content-funding-application-writing.templates.funding-application-writing-final-report.title":"起草申报书","home.scenes.gongyi-content-funding-application-writing.templates.funding-application-writing-form.prompt":"这是申报通知和申请表模板，请按我机构在平台登记的信息帮我填好资助申请表：【上传通知、申请表文件】","home.scenes.gongyi-content-funding-application-writing.templates.funding-application-writing-form.title":"填写资助申请表","home.scenes.gongyi-content-funding-application-writing.title":"撰写资助申请","home.scenes.gongyi-content-project-proposal-writing.templates.project-proposal-writing-data.prompt":"这是我们立项报告里的【项目背景】部分初稿（见下方），请帮我补充相关的行业数据或案例，让论证更有说服力","home.scenes.gongyi-content-project-proposal-writing.templates.project-proposal-writing-data.title":"补充数据支撑","home.scenes.gongyi-content-project-proposal-writing.templates.project-proposal-writing-draft.prompt":"我们是一家关注【公益方向】的公益机构，计划在【地点】开展为期【项目周期】的【项目名称】，预算【金额】，服务【受益对象】。请帮我撰写一份完整的立项报告，包含项目背景、目标、实施计划、预算明细和预期成效。","home.scenes.gongyi-content-project-proposal-writing.templates.project-proposal-writing-draft.title":"撰写立项报告","home.scenes.gongyi-content-project-proposal-writing.templates.project-proposal-writing-outline.prompt":"我们计划开展【项目名称】，服务【受益对象】，请先帮我列一份立项报告大纲，列出每个章节需要包含的核心内容","home.scenes.gongyi-content-project-proposal-writing.templates.project-proposal-writing-outline.title":"生成立项报告大纲","home.scenes.gongyi-content-project-proposal-writing.templates.project-proposal-writing-polish.prompt":"这是我写的立项报告初稿（见下方），请重点润色【项目背景】部分，让表述更专业、有数据支撑感，整体语言风格向基金会申报书看齐","home.scenes.gongyi-content-project-proposal-writing.templates.project-proposal-writing-polish.title":"润色报告内容","home.scenes.gongyi-content-project-proposal-writing.title":"撰写立项报告","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-audit-report-interpret.templates.audit-report-interpret-compare.prompt":"这是我们机构近两次的尽调报告（见下方），请帮我对比两次结果，哪些问题已经整改完成，哪些仍然存在","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-audit-report-interpret.templates.audit-report-interpret-compare.title":"对比历次尽调结果","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-audit-report-interpret.templates.audit-report-interpret-predict.prompt":"资助方即将对我们开展尽调，请根据以下项目执行情况（见下方），帮我预判可能被指出的问题，并提前准备应对说明","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-audit-report-interpret.templates.audit-report-interpret-predict.title":"预判尽调风险点","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-audit-report-interpret.templates.audit-report-interpret-remediation.prompt":"审计方要求我们完成整改并提交整改报告。请根据下方问题清单，帮我起草整改报告的框架，每项问题按“问题描述—整改措施—完成情况—证明材料”的结构写。","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-audit-report-interpret.templates.audit-report-interpret-remediation.title":"梳理整改意见","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-audit-report-interpret.templates.audit-report-interpret-summary.prompt":"这是资助方对我们做的尽调报告（见下方），请帮我用通俗语言解读：报告里指出了哪些关键问题？哪些是必须整改的红线问题，哪些只是建议优化项？","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-audit-report-interpret.templates.audit-report-interpret-summary.title":"解读尽调报告","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-audit-report-interpret.title":"解读项目尽调报告","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-beneficiary-photo-mask.templates.beneficiary-photo-mask-batch.prompt":"这是我们项目走访时拍摄的一批受助人照片（见上传图片），请帮我批量识别照片中的人脸并戴上口罩","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-beneficiary-photo-mask.templates.beneficiary-photo-mask-batch.title":"批量脱敏照片","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-beneficiary-photo-mask.templates.beneficiary-photo-mask-id.prompt":"这是一批受助人登记证件照片，识别人脸并戴口罩","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-beneficiary-photo-mask.templates.beneficiary-photo-mask-id.title":"登记照片戴口罩","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-beneficiary-photo-mask.templates.beneficiary-photo-mask-multi.prompt":"是我们项目走访时拍的受助人照片（见上传图片），请帮我识别照片中所有人脸并戴上口罩","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-beneficiary-photo-mask.templates.beneficiary-photo-mask-multi.title":"多人照片","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-beneficiary-photo-mask.templates.beneficiary-photo-mask-single.prompt":"是我们项目走访时拍的受助人照片（见上传图片），请帮我识别照片中所有人脸并戴上口罩","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-beneficiary-photo-mask.templates.beneficiary-photo-mask-single.title":"单人照片","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-beneficiary-photo-mask.title":"脱敏受助人照片","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-charity-law-old-new.templates.charity-law-old-new-disclosure-deadline.prompt":"机构年报最晚什么时候必须公开？募捐项目结束后的公示有哪些硬性时限？","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-charity-law-old-new.templates.charity-law-old-new-disclosure-deadline.title":"信息公开时限","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-charity-law-old-new.templates.charity-law-old-new-emergency-rule.prompt":"突发灾害时我们要发起紧急募捐，备案和信息公开有什么特殊流程？","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-charity-law-old-new.templates.charity-law-old-new-emergency-rule.title":"应急相关条例","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-charity-law-old-new.templates.charity-law-old-new-fundraising-cost.prompt":"我们是慈善组织，2026 年新规下募捐成本 3% 红线怎么算？管理费用和募捐成本要分开核算吗？","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-charity-law-old-new.templates.charity-law-old-new-fundraising-cost.title":"募捐成本问题","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-charity-law-old-new.templates.charity-law-old-new-personal-aid.prompt":"个人大病求助平台需要履行哪些信息核验义务？求助人虚构信息会承担什么责任？","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-charity-law-old-new.templates.charity-law-old-new-personal-aid.title":"个人求助问题","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-charity-law-old-new.title":"解读慈善法修订内容","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-finance-assistant.templates.finance-assistant-audit-letter.prompt":"审计机构对【某笔支出】提出疑问，请根据以下情况说明（见下方）帮我起草一份审计说明函，语言正式、逻辑清晰","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-finance-assistant.templates.finance-assistant-audit-letter.title":"生成审计说明函","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-finance-assistant.templates.finance-assistant-audit-prep.prompt":"我们机构要做年度审计。请帮我列一份年审资料清单，按【登记管理机关】的要求分类，并标注每项的常见问题和准备要点","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-finance-assistant.templates.finance-assistant-audit-prep.title":"梳理年审资料","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-finance-assistant.templates.finance-assistant-budget-check.prompt":"这是我们项目的预算表和实际支出台账（见下方），请帮我核对每个科目的执行率，标出超支或结余较多的项目","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-finance-assistant.templates.finance-assistant-budget-check.title":"核对预算执行","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-finance-assistant.templates.finance-assistant-receipt-sort.prompt":"这是一批报销的票据，需要识别“发票抬头、金额、日期、项目、票据编号”等信息，按【人员费用/活动费用/物资采购/管理费用】分类整理成规范台账，并标出缺票、超预算等异常项","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-finance-assistant.templates.finance-assistant-receipt-sort.title":"梳理票据台账","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-finance-assistant.title":"处理审计\u0026票据","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-skill-builder-assistant.templates.skill-builder-assistant-build-skill.prompt":"帮我把【公益项目数据清洗+可视化报告】的流程固化成 skill，以后我一句话就能触发","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-skill-builder-assistant.templates.skill-builder-assistant-build-skill.title":"搭建 Skill","home.scenes.gongyi-project-tools-skill-builder-assistant.templates.skill-builder-assistant-checkin-tool.prompt":"我们机构经常需要统计志愿者签到和服务时长